ble into other tissue-specific heterotrimeric sodium channels (PubMed:7499195). [Isoform 2]: ENaC channels including this isoform exhibit greater conductance."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}